  "manifest_excludes_itself": true,
  "manifest_self_exclusion_reason": "The manifest is written after the artifacts it describes, so an entry for its own bytes could not exist when it is built. Its own file SHA-256 and Git blob SHA are reported by this script's output and are recoverable with sha256sum and git hash-object.",
  "never_conflate": "An internal material hash, a file SHA-256 and a Git blob SHA are three values over three different inputs. They are listed side by side so no reader has to guess which one a number is.",
